   ],
   "fitness_value_in_ancestor": "constant-time neighbour discovery for coalescing at one word of overhead",
   "failure_landscape": "by reading: a corrupted head propagates (next_chunk arithmetic); the optional FOOTERS check word and the address/pinuse checks exist because of it",
